~ start
if ProgressManager.has_completed(&"HAS_MET_PLAYER"):
	if Father.is_angry:
		Father: We've said enough for now. Go and see your mother.
		=> END
	elif Father.is_happy:
		Father: Still here?
		Qaswar: It's good to see you, Father.
		Father: And you, son. Now let your mother have a turn.
		=> END
	else:
		Father: Your mother's inside. Don't keep her waiting.
		=> END
else:
	Father: Qaswar!

Qaswar: Father.

Father: There you are. Where have you been?

Qaswar: I met some friends on the way home.
Qaswar: I meant to stay a moment, but we got talking.

Father: A long moment.

Qaswar: ...I'm sorry.

Father: Your mother has been to the door three times.
Father: I was about to come looking for you.

Qaswar: You didn't need to. I know the road.

Father: I know you do.
Father: It's who else might be on it that worries me.

Qaswar: Nothing happened.

Father: I'm glad.
Father: Next time, send word if you're going to be late.

- I will. I didn't mean to worry you.
	$> Father.is_angry = false
	$> Father.is_happy = true
	Father: I know, son.
	Father: Go on. Let your mother see you're home.
- You can't keep worrying every time I leave.
	$> Father.is_happy = false
	$> Father.is_angry = true
	Father: And you can't expect us to know you're safe when you tell us nothing.
	Qaswar: Father, I—
	Father: Go inside, Qaswar. Your mother's waiting.

$> Father._on_flip_parent_sprite(Rage.global_position)
$> Rage.pause_bark()
Father: All right, Rage.[wait=0.5] He's home.
Father: Sit.
$> Rage.sit()
$> ProgressManager.complete(&"HAS_MET_PLAYER")
$> ProgressManager.complete(&"TALK_TO_FATHER")
Father: [wait=1.0]Good boy.
=> END
